	quests: [
		{
			description: [
				"&lGrass&r is the most basic type of ground. Everything grows on it except for the light blue and magenta flowers."
				""
				"It gives no boosts, it has no downsides. Perfectly balanced, as all things should be."
				""
				"To change the ground type to it use:"
				""
				"&7turtle.&6changeGround&7(consts.&6GROUND_TYPES&7.&6DIRT&7)&r"
			]
			disable_toast: true
			icon: "minecraft:grass_block"
			id: "0FEB2E777C48046A"
			shape: "rsquare"
			size: 4.0d
			title: "Grass"
			x: -6.5d
			y: -8.25d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["6DFFC25C0DFEDD5E"]
			description: [
				"&lWater&r cannot be planted on. It is, however, useful in that it boosts the growth rate of all adjacent flowers by 12.5% per each water block adjacent to the plant."
				""
				"This means that if a flower is completely surrounded by water, it will grow 1.5 times as fast as without it. Water is also useful for counteracting the effects of mycelium, which slows down adjacent flowers."
				""
				"To change the ground type to it use:"
				""
				"&7turtle.&6changeGround&7(consts.&6GROUND_TYPES&7.&6WATER&7)&r"
			]
			disable_toast: true
			icon: "minecraft:water_bucket"
			id: "595DE9FFA087EFD3"
			shape: "rsquare"
			size: 4.0d
			title: "Water"
			x: -2.5d
			y: -8.25d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["63E2B1514EF8298D"]
			description: [
				"&lMycelium&r makes flowers selfish. It slows down all adjacent plants, but it increases the drops of the flower on it twofolds."
				""
				"An adjacent flower will be slowed down even if it itself is standing on mycelium, so make sure they are separated by at least 1 block from each other. Some plants can only grow on mycelium (prominently the magenta and light blue flowers)."
				""
				"To change the ground type to it use:"
				""
				"&7turtle.&6changeGround&7(consts.&6GROUND_TYPES&7.&6MYCELIUM&7)&r"
			]
			disable_toast: true
			icon: "minecraft:mycelium"
			id: "4E02E742CB073195"
			shape: "rsquare"
			size: 4.0d
			title: "Mycelium"
			x: -6.5d
			y: -4.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["1F2CD0471A6F7831"]
			description: [
				"&lFarmland&r acts similarly to grass, with 2 key exceptions. The first one - it does not allow black flowers to grow on it like weeds; so you can mark out spots where you don't want them using this ground type, and make it so that black flowers only grow where you want them."
				""
				"The second key exception is that flowers grow 30% slower on them, so if growth rate is key for your type of automation, this might not be the way to go."
				""
				"To change the ground type to it use:"
				""
				"&7turtle.&6changeGround&7(consts.&6GROUND_TYPES&7.&6FARMLAND&7)&r"
			]
			disable_toast: true
			icon: "tgwr:still_farmland"
			id: "6D7DDC31B59991EB"
			shape: "rsquare"
			size: 4.0d
			title: "Farmland"
			x: -2.5d
			y: -4.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["4A412853862B0C31"]
			description: [
				"&lThe Mystical Light Blue Flower&r (if unlocked) will grow instead of the blue flower when planted on mycelium."
				""
				"The mycelium drop multiplier will still be applied. Enjoy my leniency &m(and incompetence)&r."
			]
			disable_toast: true
			icon: "botania:light_blue_mystical_flower"
			id: "35828B5CB17EABDD"
			shape: "square"
			size: 1.6d
			title: "Mystical Light Blue Flower"
			x: -1.5d
			y: -0.3d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["3239D8D7416C4208"]
			description: [
				"&lThe Mystical Light Gray Flower&r likes company. By default it only has a 20% chance to grow."
				""
				"However, the more unqiue flowers adjacent to it, the more the chance. Per every unique flower the chance increases by 20%, with a maximum of 100% with all 4 adjacent flowers being unique."
				""
				"Another light gray flower adjacent also counts as a unique one, if you were wondering."
				""
				"To plant this flower, use (requires a gray petal that will be consumed):"
				""
				"&7turtle.&6plant&7(consts.&6PLANTS&7.&6LIGHT_GRAY_FLOWER&7)&r"
			]
			disable_toast: true
			icon: "botania:light_gray_mystical_flower"
			id: "3F30E7EF2CFBE53E"
			shape: "square"
			size: 1.6d
			title: "Mystical Light Gray Flower"
			x: -1.5d
			y: 2.7d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["4B00A2A7941EED5C"]
			description: [
				"&lThe Mystical Gray Flower&r only takes 3 seconds to grow without any water around it. However, there is a catch."
				""
				"It only grows while the turtle is directly above it. Since you will most likely already need to wait for other flowers to grow, you can use that as an opporunity to get gray petals as well."
				""
				"To plant this flower, use (requires a black petal that will be consumed):"
				""
				"&7turtle.&6plant&7(consts.&6PLANTS&7.&6GRAY_FLOWER&7)&r"
