		{
			dependencies: ["6C5592FB2165AA3F"]
			description: [
				"&lThe Mystical Black Flower&r is similar to a weed in real life. It grows when you least expect it and the most use you will get out of it is if you pull it out as soon as possible."
				""
				"Black flowers only start growing after getting a 2x2 expansion upgrade. You will only get black petals from them if you gather them BEFORE they grow, otherwise they will drop nothing."
