		{
			dependencies: ["52B44F39DD80611D"]
			description: [
				"&lThe Blue Mystical Flower&r can only grow when adjacent to the border of your garden. You know what happens to them if they don't."
				""
				"Every time you update your garden's size, make sure to change the place where they grow, because flowers on the right and bottom edges or the garden will no longer be on them. "
				""
				"For this goal, the &7turtle.&6getRange()&r method might come in handy (read \"Gathering Data\" for more information)"
				""
				"To plant this flower, use (requires a cyan and a magenta petal that will be consumed):"
				""
				"&7turtle.&6plant&7(consts.&6PLANTS&7.&6BLUE_FLOWER&7)&r"
			]
			disable_toast: true
			icon: "botania:blue_mystical_flower"
			id: "30951789055D93F2"
			shape: "diamond"
			size: 1.6d
			title: "Mystical Blue Flower"
			x: -5.5d
