		{
			dependencies: ["7A9534CFD0F1F23C"]
			description: [
				"&lThe Mystical Green Flower&r can massively reduced your headaches when it comes to the large amounts of petals required for the quests."
				""
				"When gathered, they give a temporary 10-second 1+ increase to the amount of petals dropped from gathered flowers. This effect stacks with other multipliers, which can snowball into you getting ginormous quantities of petals."
				""
				"To plant this flower, use (requires a yellow and a cyan petal that will be consumed):"
				""
				"&7turtle.&6plant&7(consts.&6PLANTS&7.&6GREEN_FLOWER&7)&r"
			]
			disable_toast: true
